# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dsh-test - attribute rules
#
# Line endings: store and check out files byte-for-byte. Many files in this
# repository are FROZEN EVIDENCE whose SHA-256 digests are recorded in reports
# (rc.1 / rc.2 / rc.3 change reports, RELEASE-REPORT.md, RELEASES.md). Git's
# default Windows autocrlf would rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout and silently
# change those bytes, invalidating every recorded digest. So: no conversion.
#
# The cost is that a Windows editor may show LF files without CRLF; the
# benefit is that a clone reproduces the exact bytes that were verified.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

* -text

# Binary formats are never merged or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
